OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA rather cloudy day with the
OL,6,Fchance of the odd shower, mostly in
OL,7,Fthe north. Most places staying dry
OL,8,Fwith periods of hazy sunshine.
OL,9,FBreezier and somewhat fresher, but
OL,10,Fstill feeling rather warm, with
OL,11,Ftemperatures around average.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FOvernight, rain moves into
OL,14,Fthe west. Mostly light but turning
OL,15,Fshowery into the early hours. Showers
OL,16,Fease by dawn with some clear spells
OL,17,Fdeveloping. Feeling fresher and less
OL,18,Fhumid.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
