OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CWednesday:FA mostly dry start with the
OL,6,Fodd shower developing around midday.
OL,7,FThese moves off quickly to the east,
OL,8,Fleaving sunny spells for most.
OL,9,FTemperatures around or just below
OL,10,Faverage.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FA
OL,13,Fnortherly wind develops for the next
OL,14,Ffew days, allowing temperatures to
OL,15,Fdrop below average. Thunder showers
OL,16,Ffor Thursday and Friday, but brighter
OL,17,Fand drier for Saturday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
